{#
OpenCloud (#476) needs no application-side registration — each user connects
with their own app token — but two server settings decide whether that works
at all: app tokens must be accepted, and public links are refused without a
password unless the admin turns that policy off. Both are stated here, because
the admin is the one who can change them and the user only sees the failure.
#}
